clauses.clause:
This directive applies to the organizations listed in section 6 of the Policy on the Management of Executives and to employees: Appointed or deployed to positions in the Executive (EX) Group; andOccupying excluded or unrepresented positions in the following:
Defence Scientific Service (DS) Group, levels 7A, 7B, and 8;
Medical Officer (MD‑MOF) Group, levels 4 and 5;
Medical Specialist (MD‑MSP) Group, level 3; and
Law Management (LC) Group.
